  "_tree": [
	"A-20 pet skill trees (scripts/PetTree.cs; the Tree tab of the pets menu). A pet has pointsPerLevel points for every level after its first; respec costs respecBase + respecPerPoint x points spent (gold).",
	"familyOf: archetype -> family (others: fliers -> flyer, the rest -> beast). Each family has three branches; a node takes up to max ranks once req points are spent in its branch; cap = the branch's capstone.",
	"mods (per rank): hpP atkP defP spdP magP = that stat %, powerP = power of every skill %, cdP = skill cooldowns % (negative = faster), critP = critical chance, leechP = damage returned as its health, guardP = damage it takes % (negative = less),",
	"  regenP = health regeneration %, mountSpdP / mountStP = riding speed / mount stamina %, xpP = experience it gains %, lootRange = metres added to its auto-loot reach. skillP: { skill id: power % }. skill = a skill it learns from this node.",
	"Stat mods also count in Soul Duels (they change its stats); power, cooldown, crit, leech, guard and regen apply to the companion in the world."
  ],
